      "writtenOn": "2017-11-28T04:50:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would rather shift the hysteresis down so that charge_phase \u003d 1 when bat_voltage \u003e TRIP_VOLTAGE, rather than always changing phase HYSTERESIS_MV too late.\n\nAlternatively, get rid of the voltage hysteresis entirely, and make charge_phase only transition from 0\u003d\u003e1 during charging, and reset to 0 when charging is disabled.",
